<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<speak version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="zh-CN">
  <p xml:id="seg-01"><s><prosody rate="98%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">欢迎来到荔枝贡运对抗赛！</prosody></s><break time="120ms"/><s><prosody rate="99%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">红队<emphasis level="moderate">神经突触袭击队</emphasis>，迎战蓝队<emphasis level="moderate">代码即答案</emphasis>！</prosody></s><break time="140ms"/><s><prosody rate="96%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">双方各带一百篓好果，鲜度全满，从岭南果园出发。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="102%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">穿过朱雀门，把荔枝送进兴庆宫——<emphasis level="strong">比赛开始！</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-02"><s><prosody rate="104%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">开局就分路！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="100ms"/><s><prosody rate="99%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队走官道，红队钻进山路。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="95%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">官道更快，鲜度损耗也低，蓝队先抢推进速度；红队宁可慢一点，也要沿山路直奔潼关，争取沿线任务。</prosody></s><break time="160ms"/><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">看样子，红队想抢先占住潼关。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-03"><s><prosody rate="98%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队先到南岭驿，车头不停，直奔江南码头。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">红队还在五岭山道。</prosody></s><break time="140ms"/><s><prosody rate="95%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">官道路短，码头又有任务和快马，蓝队边赶路边拿资源。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-04"><s><prosody rate="105%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">蓝队到达江南码头！</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="102%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">清障任务完成，<emphasis level="strong">三十分到手</emphasis>，障碍同步清除。</prosody></s><break time="120ms"/><s><prosody rate="105%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">蓝队拿到快马，立刻使用！</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="96%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">这一段官道，蓝队把分数和快马都收下了。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-05"><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">第一轮酷暑落地，鲜度损耗加重。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="96%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队借快马切进水路，红队还在山路。</prosody></s><break time="160ms"/><s><prosody rate="93%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">天气一压下来，停留时间就更要命——谁少耽搁，谁就能少丢品质。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-06"><s><prosody rate="105%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">红队鲜度先破九十，<emphasis level="strong">第一篓好果转坏！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="180ms"/><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">山路本就最伤鲜度，酷暑又压一层，代价立刻出现。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="96%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队还在水路，三十分在手；红队暂时零分。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-07"><s><prosody rate="97%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队进入洞庭水驿，水路换运结束。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">水路更快、更省鲜度，可酷暑还是把蓝队压到九十以下。</prosody></s><break time="160ms"/><s><prosody rate="98%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">双方各有一篓好果转坏，红队抵达秦岭栈道。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-08"><s><prosody rate="106%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">红队走山路的回报终于来了！</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="103%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">两项栈道复核完成，<emphasis level="strong">任务分追到六十。</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="120ms"/><s><prosody rate="99%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">红队开启冰鉴，鲜度从八十四点二七拉回九十四点二七，<emphasis level="moderate">重新越过九十！</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-09"><s><prosody rate="104%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">暴雨压住水路！</emphasis></prosody></s><s><prosody rate="99%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队正赶往洛阳驿，速度和鲜度同时吃亏；红队沿山路逼近潼关。</prosody></s><break time="160ms"/><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">蓝队开局抢出的距离，正在被一点点吃掉。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-10"><s><prosody rate="107%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">蓝队冲进洛阳驿，拿下码头争船，三十分入账！</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="104%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">蓝队紧接着完成武关清障，再收三十分，<emphasis level="strong">九十分门槛到手！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="180ms"/><s><prosody rate="97%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">这条官道接水路的走法，让蓝队连续拿分。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-11"><s><prosody rate="106%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">蓝队在洛阳驿又完成两项码头争船，<emphasis level="strong">任务分直上一百五十！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="120ms"/><s><prosody rate="102%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">蓝队拿到短程马，立即使用，车队马上开往武关。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="96%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">红队还在山路上追潼关。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-12"><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">两条路线的得失已经很清楚。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="95%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队任务多、资源足，先把分差拉开；红队拿分少，位置却更靠近潼关。</prosody></s><break time="180ms"/><s><prosody rate="98%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">山雾预告亮起，双方正在关口汇合。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-13"><s><prosody rate="98%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">红队主车还在山路，红队的小分队已经抢先探查潼关驿。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="93%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">这个标记只生效一次，会缩短进站后的第一项任务或交接。</prosody></s><break time="160ms"/><s><prosody rate="102%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">蓝队进入武关，追兵到了。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-14"><s><prosody rate="102%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">蓝队从武关冲向潼关，红队也到了山路末段。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="103%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">山雾拖慢红队，红队还是抢先进站；蓝队已经跑过一半路程，两队之间的距离正在迅速缩短。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-15"><s><prosody rate="111%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">红队抢到潼关！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="80ms"/><s><prosody rate="110%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">红队用两篓好果，换出<emphasis level="strong">六点设卡！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="100ms"/><s><prosody rate="112%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">蓝队已经冲到百分之六十二点一，关卡就在眼前落下——蓝队再往前一步，<emphasis level="strong">直接被挡！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="260ms"/><s><prosody rate="104%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">潼关攻防，开打！</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-16"><s><prosody rate="109%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">蓝队五次推进，<emphasis level="strong">全被挡下！</emphasis></prosody></s><s><prosody rate="105%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">进度锁在百分之六十二点一。</prosody></s><break time="100ms"/><s><prosody rate="108%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">红队借这段封路时间完成两项复核，任务分从六十追到一百二十！</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-17"><s><prosody rate="112%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">蓝队开始拆卡！</emphasis></prosody></s><s><prosody rate="113%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">第一支小分队赶到，防守从六点降到四点；</prosody></s><break time="90ms"/><s><prosody rate="113%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">第二支接上，防守降到两点；</prosody></s><break time="90ms"/><s><prosody rate="113%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">第三支到位，<emphasis level="strong">清空最后两点！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="180ms"/><s><prosody rate="105%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">蓝队投入全部六名人手，终于打开潼关通路！</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-18"><s><prosody rate="97%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队还在一轮轮削卡，红队已经完成交接，驶向关中平原。</prosody></s><break time="160ms"/><s><prosody rate="96%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">关卡防守清零后，蓝队才重新起步；蓝队鲜度紧接着跌破八十，<emphasis level="moderate">第二篓好果转坏。</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-19"><s><prosody rate="98%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队完成潼关交接。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="105%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">红队在关中平原拿下限时过关，<emphasis level="strong">任务分追到一百五十！</emphasis></prosody></s><s><prosody rate="101%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">随后，红队开启冰鉴，鲜度回到九十二点一。</prosody></s><break time="180ms"/><s><prosody rate="95%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">两队任务分相同，红队位置更靠前。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-20"><s><prosody rate="103%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">红队的小分队先探灞桥驿；主车进站后，<emphasis level="moderate">宫前交接明显提速！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="120ms"/><s><prosody rate="101%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">蓝队从潼关切上直达朱雀门的支路，绕开关中平原和灞桥，开始抢时间。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-21"><s><prosody rate="101%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">红队的小分队又先一步探查朱雀门，主车随即抵达。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="99%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队还在支路追赶。</prosody></s><break time="120ms"/><s><prosody rate="106%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">宫宴冲刺开启，验核窗口开放！</emphasis></prosody></s><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">红队虽然先到，却没有马上开始验核。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-22"><s><prosody rate="110%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">红队不验核，先封路！</emphasis></prosody></s><s><prosody rate="108%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">朱雀门四点设卡完成。</prosody></s><break time="100ms"/><s><prosody rate="111%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">蓝队已经走到支路的百分之八十一点七，眼看就到门前，推进却被关卡按住！</prosody></s><break time="120ms"/><s><prosody rate="108%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">蓝队连试五次，还是过不去！</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-23"><s><prosody rate="99%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">蓝队现在真难受！</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="93%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">冲刺阶段不能再派小分队，主车还在支路上，也不能直接强闯。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="92%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">若要改线，就得放弃百分之八十一点七的进度，退回潼关。</prosody></s><break time="220ms"/><s><prosody rate="92%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">蓝队选择等风化。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-24"><s><prosody rate="93%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">第二轮酷暑压下来。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="92%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">蓝队原地等待，关卡从四点风化到三点，破关悬赏出现；红队的探路标记也在等待中失效。</prosody></s><break time="220ms"/><s><prosody rate="92%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">蓝队保住路线进度，时间和鲜度却在流失。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-25"><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">关卡防守只剩两点，蓝队还是不改线。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="92%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">五项任务和潼关交接都做完了，可进不了朱雀门，验核和送达就无法开始。</prosody></s><break time="180ms"/><s><prosody rate="98%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队鲜度又破七十，<emphasis level="moderate">第三篓好果转坏。</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-26"><s><prosody rate="101%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">宫门防守从两点掉到一点，<emphasis level="strong">终于彻底风化！</emphasis></prosody></s><s><prosody rate="102%" pitch="+1st" volume="medium">第一道关卡消失，悬赏也没了。</prosody></s><break time="240ms"/><s><prosody rate="97%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">蓝队终于等到继续前进的机会——</prosody></s><break time="160ms"/><s><prosody rate="93%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">可红队还守在朱雀门，仍能再设一道关卡。</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-27"><s><prosody rate="114%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">红队再次设卡！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="100ms"/><s><prosody rate="112%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">蓝队又被挡在百分之八十四点一！</prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-28"><s><prosody rate="112%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">蓝队又尝试推进五次，<emphasis level="strong">五次全被挡下！</emphasis></prosody></s><s><prosody rate="107%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">蓝队的主车仍被挡在百分之八十四点一。</prosody></s><break time="120ms"/><s><prosody rate="111%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">红队转身，开始宫门验核！</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-29"><s><prosody rate="114%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">红队通过验核！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="80ms"/><s><prosody rate="114%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud">疾行令随即开启，<emphasis level="strong">红队主车直冲兴庆宫！</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
  <p xml:id="seg-30"><s><prosody rate="110%" pitch="+2st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">红队送达成功！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="280ms"/><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">红队送达九十篓好果，鲜度七十九点七一。</prosody></s><s><prosody rate="92%" pitch="+0st" volume="medium">送达基础分二百四十、好果分一百六十二、鲜度分一百四十三、任务分一百八十——<emphasis level="strong">红队总分七百二十五！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="220ms"/><s><prosody rate="94%" pitch="-1st" volume="medium">蓝队完成五项任务，却被第二道关卡挡在朱雀门外，没能验核送达，最终只得到八十分。</prosody></s><break time="360ms"/><s><prosody rate="105%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud"><emphasis level="strong">最终比分定格为七百二十五比八十！</emphasis></prosody></s><break time="420ms"/><s><prosody rate="101%" pitch="+1st" volume="loud">恭喜红队，<emphasis level="strong">神经突触袭击队！</emphasis></prosody></s></p>
</speak>
